WEBVTT

00:18:26.831 --> 00:18:30.091
how dare you, you're invading
my kid's privacy,

00:18:30.115 --> 00:18:32.091
they'll have this record their whole life

00:18:32.115 --> 00:18:34.471
that they didn't pay attention
in geography class,

00:18:34.495 --> 00:18:35.646
go away."

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.536
So there's difference in culture.

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:40.722
In China, there's just
a fundamentally different stance

00:18:40.746 --> 00:18:45.410
on how much permission we should give
the government, say,

00:18:45.434 --> 00:18:50.045
to intrude on our lives
for "the greater good."

00:18:50.069 --> 00:18:52.908
You've obviously lived
a lot of time in the US,

00:18:52.932 --> 00:18:54.860
you know both counties super well.

00:18:54.884 --> 00:18:57.053
Talk about that cultural difference.

00:18:57.077 --> 00:19:01.394
KFL: Actually, I totally understand
and appreciate the American values,